Aim:-
Write a program to implement while loop statement in python

Algorithm:-
1. Start
2. Input a number n from the user
3. Set fact = 1
4. Set i = 1
5. Check if i ≤ n
6. If true, calculate fact = fact × i
7. Increase i = i + 1
8. Print fact
9. Repeat steps 5–8 until i > n
10. Stop
11. End

Code:-
n=int(input("enter a number:"))
fact=1
i=1
while i<=n:
   fact*=i
   i+=1
   print(fact)

